The UI must feel like:

Treasure Hunt
+
Ancient mysterious ruins
+
Programming terminal
+
Modern game interface

Avoid an excessive "AI-generated cyberpunk" appearance.

Avoid:

* excessive neon
* generic hacker imagery
* Matrix-style falling code everywhere
* cluttered dashboards
* giant glowing cards
* unnecessary gradients
* normal quiz/exam UI

Use a sophisticated dark adventure interface.

Suggested palette:

