# 24. ADMIN TEAM CONTROL

Admin must be able to:

* inspect team progress
* see completed levels
* see current level
* see score history
* see hint usage
* see incorrect attempt count
* manually add/remove points
* restore lives
* provide a hint
* reset a level
* unlock a level
* move a team to another level
* pause a team
* resume a team
* disqualify a team if necessary

Every admin modification should be logged.

